        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_clinical",
        "text": "Yesterday it changed from light postmenopausal bleeding to sudden heavy vaginal bleeding, soaking through 2 thick pads in 3 hours with dark blood clots.",
        "sha256": "1be44f12a7ed869ec5a6c10bc16be26869baaa4567e246e24458491c6a29c5bf",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_colloquial",
        "text": "yesterday it went from light spotting to sudden flooding, soaking through 2 thick pads in 3 hours with dark blood clots.",
        "sha256": "ef9e1ebdc6fc24ea7ef5d83c8a80eac7040a6939fc0343c85d4675eeb1fc049d",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t05_clinical",
        "text": "For the past 2 weeks I have also had a steady dull pelvic pain every evening and felt fatigue every day doing normal chores.",
